      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think trackers dying could use a bit more graceful handling in general. It would make the most sense to just lock the limb that the tracker is attached to, or even partially revert it to procedural motion. Or maybe automatically swap to 3pt when 6pt fails. Don't throw away useful tracking data when one tracker dies. Mixing IK solutions seamlessly sounds complicated though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
