      "value": "@{5f50687837bf962e69ae2921|full_name}: Switching tracking types automatically upon one of the trackers dying is something I would be sad to see. The ability to lock in a 6pt pose is actually something very useful as Rak mentioned below. It'd be a shame to lose. It allows you get in a comfy position and turn off the trackers; so if you wanted to watch a movie while not being scuffed & or while enjoying a blanket IRL it's easy to do so.",
