      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name}: A freeze IK button feels like the best option then to allow yourself to stay in whatever position you want and still handle trackers going offline more gracefully.\nInstead of relying on accidental behavior like the entire IK freezing if one tracker/controller is lost, we should be asking what was it about it that people actually liked, and implement that as a feature that is actually thought out.",
